    Bug 1959752 - Account Hub Edit Configuration should be there for add-on Exchange config, not EWS. r=mkmelin

    **How to Test**
    - Update mailnews.auto_config.addons_url value to "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vDeo/ah-addons-test/main/addons.json"
    - Open account hub and use the email testaccounts@o365.thunderbird.net, skipping the auth modal
    - Select the exchange add-on option, edit configuration should not be there
    - Select the ews exchange option, edit configuration should not be there
    - Selecting the add-on option, install the add-on
    - Edit configuration button should be there
    - Clicking edit configuration should show an Exchange config in the manual config area
    - Going back and clicking around the config options should maintain accuracy when showing config data

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D245095

